# Line endings — see AGENTS.md > Coding conventions.
# Text files are stored LF in the repo and checked out CRLF on every platform,
# regardless of each clone's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# The one exception is scripts `sh` executes: a hook checked out with CRLF dies
# with `bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M`. Pin such files to LF when they are added:
scripts/.githooks/** text eol=lf
